      "tags": "basic channel / dub techno",
      "excerpt": "Marco Cassanelli flexes fruity Italian dub house strutters for burgoening Kernow label, Alt Dub Records. Rolling out in a style he’s worked toward for 13 years, the ‘Visions EP’ shakes out feathered chords on an effortlessly lush and strident title tune, while ‘Free To Fly’ hinges fuggier chords around a louche disco claps and well-oiled disco bassline. The EP standout is ‘Absolute’, a fine slice of vocal deep house dream-pop, subtly calling to mind Moritz Von Oswald’s gem of a remix for 2Raumwo",
      "body": "Marco Cassanelli flexes fruity Italian dub house strutters for burgoening Kernow label, Alt Dub Records.\n\nRolling out in a style he’s worked toward for 13 years, the ‘Visions EP’ shakes out feathered chords on an effortlessly lush and strident title tune, while ‘Free To Fly’ hinges fuggier chords around a louche disco claps and well-oiled disco bassline. The EP standout is ‘Absolute’, a fine slice of vocal deep house dream-pop, subtly calling to mind Moritz Von Oswald’s gem of a remix for 2Raumwohnung.",
