      "tags": "techno / house",
      "excerpt": "NOLA via ATL club catalyst Leonce runs the ‘floor red on the first sign of things to come for London’s Local Action. ’Severing Elevation’ chases their frothier, kinkier ’25 cuts beside Pangaea, for fabric Originals, with a steaming reminder of why they’re so in demand as a DJ and producer by those in the know. Ruggeder aspects of Jersey club and high pressure ATL dances are galvanised with polychromatic synths and a swingeing acid bassline to proper, deadly impact, especially when the leads detu",
      "body": "NOLA via ATL club catalyst Leonce runs the ‘floor red on the first sign of things to come for London’s Local Action.\n\n’Severing Elevation’ chases their frothier, kinkier ’25 cuts beside Pangaea, for fabric Originals, with a steaming reminder of why they’re so in demand as a DJ and producer by those in the know. Ruggeder aspects of Jersey club and high pressure ATL dances are galvanised with polychromatic synths and a swingeing acid bassline to proper, deadly impact, especially when the leads detune and scream with peak time fever in the latter half.",
      "site_id": "boomkat",
      "crawl_status": "success",
      "type": "feature"
    },
