      "tags": "indie / alternative",
      "excerpt": "Another bite-sized teaser of Chang's upcoming 'been thinking bout confession', 'Bad zen' packages the soaring title track with a handful of the album's other singles. If you need more convincing before you dig into the full length, this should do the job. 'Bad zen' is actually one of the album's more restrained tracks, led by Chang's most melancholy vocal turn that she accompanies with wobbly synth strings and jazzy guitars. Compared with 'Auratones of Desire', that's also bundled on the EP, it'",
      "body": "Another bite-sized teaser of Chang's upcoming 'been thinking bout confession', 'Bad zen' packages the soaring title track with a handful of the album's other singles.\n\nIf you need more convincing before you dig into the full length, this should do the job. 'Bad zen' is actually one of the album's more restrained tracks, led by Chang's most melancholy vocal turn that she accompanies with wobbly synth strings and jazzy guitars. Compared with 'Auratones of Desire', that's also bundled on the EP, it's practically horizontal - thank goodness there's 'No avatar', the album's most chewable track, included too.",
      "site_id": "boomkat",
      "crawl_status": "success",
      "type": "feature"
    },
